      "uid": "zhcn:8ea26a83266fd09ea594dd13",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "借着与劲敌一决胜负，樱花千代王也得以\n成长及掌握新的能力。她期望往后也能继续\n与劲敌们较劲。然而──",
      "source_fingerprint": "e91773bdb614bd1b47db7f93506160d5ff52f8e1e9f5cd3d85a30555f32de7f7",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
