    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ed19f8914872bd37e7e254cf",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "独白",
      "source_fingerprint": "182cc3cf530783b6da4d14ed3d7d177e4428e3ba9645975eb9ef22934b7d221c",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1069/storytimeline_501069424.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        4,
        "name"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/4/name"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:146a5e6fd76c28a5a9a30da0",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "劲敌之一的目白阿尔丹突然在她面前倒下。\n至今那些超出负担的训练，\n让她的双腿变得非常脆弱。",
      "source_fingerprint": "3f7d77a7e815698aa8997f8ab1eb3a3192c24af03375851a58aca1abde50ebcf",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1069/storytimeline_501069424.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        4,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/4/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c3256bd1900a18f053561c07",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "独白",
      "source_fingerprint": "182cc3cf530783b6da4d14ed3d7d177e4428e3ba9645975eb9ef22934b7d221c",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1069/storytimeline_501069424.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        5,
        "name"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/5/name"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:127b6f99b00d527897a5a39b",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "她打算离开竞赛的世界。\n然而樱花千代王对她发誓，\n自己身为劲敌一定会让她回心转意。",
      "source_fingerprint": "81d827761635063484b3bdd6cce509bcdaa411ae4b4094d8c1fe1533dac76396",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1069/storytimeline_501069424.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        5,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/5/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:8695cf46881b2d1f0b84ce4d",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "日本德比结束后・花蕊尚未绽放",
      "source_fingerprint": "c54b42c00489ffb8758bf82cbff62094e852bebad606870309d612acc0c23628",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1069/storytimeline_501069424.json",
      "json_path": [
        "title"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/title"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:3f802ece7c859584cea1baa8",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "樱花千代王击败小栗帽等有望选手，\n世人都说这次真是大爆冷门了。",
      "source_fingerprint": "f668ac3e0cb661433c3fdf62230f0cb6f01f5a11b82913e2343265aa46fd7edc",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1069/storytimeline_501069425.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        0,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/0/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b92e18fdc104b8c5eb921c6b",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "但她不会就此满足。\n因为她还得继续磨练自己，\n直到真正成为丸善斯基的劲敌为止。",
      "source_fingerprint": "5bad34204d44ffff4329fe5b7bfab8f993fa097718df6c6d19d15d009f71ef80",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1069/storytimeline_501069425.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        1,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/1/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:dfabda74adb5e2e6c778e7be",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "她那藏不住的竞争意识与气魄，\n还有那双仿佛饿狼的眼神──\n掳获了丸善斯基的心。",
      "source_fingerprint": "3187bdd60dcf7db42ba1ece75f7df87986dbe17ada672b399c724fd30b12ccde",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1069/storytimeline_501069425.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        2,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/2/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:20f5f4123adca5627fffa6c5",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "接着两人许下约定，东京的草地2400米。\n唯一一场与“日本德比”有相同条件的GⅠ。\n就在明年……一年后的日本杯上再度决战吧。",
      "source_fingerprint": "e7df4f3edcd8f5dde6b25a6577bc3bd089183c3d368f329dbb8381a1e6963d93",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1069/storytimeline_501069425.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        3,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/3/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a1524ba44399f5126c2ea915",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "英里路线的“安田纪念”",
