    {
      "uid": "zhcn:48bb5a0d086a72fcb8d42231",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "樱花千代王燃起斗志，在终将到来的那一天，\n非得让她认可自己就是真正的劲敌。\n为了帮助她提升实力，下一个目标赛事是──",
      "source_fingerprint": "6e568beb9aef3a2d02536274ba35ee8c9f7914514c561ff532d640a81548a6d5",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1069/storytimeline_501069425.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        4,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/4/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:3ab0608df924ec9527122d54",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "目标竞赛就是安田纪念。",
      "source_fingerprint": "6eec3be5da54449f3c6bd9f5939f09d0b3158d36633e114038ca56733b33e08b",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1069/storytimeline_501069425.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        5,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/5/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c7dc68a756679255d9b9633a",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "就决定挑战“安田纪念”了。\n这都是为了磨练出\n能与“超跑”匹敌的速度──！",
      "source_fingerprint": "ef84e5ff2ca96e6021f9fc0ba7149bdb1bc328fd5c86506647ee574dc73f4ac3",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1069/storytimeline_501069425.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        6,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/6/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ffb946e375226598a83dc7dd",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "目标竞赛就是宝冢纪念。",
      "source_fingerprint": "40e6c53a0151997b11610fb57ba4ba4ed552b14ca3b15be9751194bb5196cdec",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
