    {
      "uid": "zhcn:41dccef6f4d7253db88ff7ca",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "眼前那堵墙太厚实、太高大了吗？\n樱花千代王不敌那个压倒性的实力。",
      "source_fingerprint": "3fee0aa13416d3ed259d5c90cfb121e103b116b7f37e1427b36526d0a0bd58e5",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1069/storytimeline_501069426.json",
