    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:4a225e97cff99f2871e74069",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "但她的竞争意识与气魄即使落败仍不曾消退，\n还有那双仿佛饿狼的眼神──\n掳获了丸善斯基的心。",
      "source_fingerprint": "5df38871dc8aedc3a77eee313439abf6f8c38b4d2e2feceea00c4df2fb82fcc3",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
