      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "天皇赏（秋）结束后・厚墙",
      "source_fingerprint": "41f28c2b6559598a31e9a3246be39bef6fe95d54b5c56188c8d2a0431558435f",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1069/storytimeline_501069426.json",
      "json_path": [
        "title"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/title"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:019bca06edf5558aec28a8d9",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "纵然樱花千代王有不错的表现，但她仍感到\n体力严重透支。而青竹回忆则是比赛一结束\n就能精神奕奕地宣告将连续挑战下一场比赛。",
      "source_fingerprint": "7c26f1cf6a05252d6b3b1861023c54653177b685732c5a39cc37e4e7bc6c8bf3",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1069/storytimeline_501069427.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        0,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/0/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:63194308ca8aba9ffcc55c2a",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "她在那一刻感到体内似乎有某种事物开始\n碎裂。跟“未来一片光明的赛马娘”相比，\n觉得自己开始逐渐变得衰弱……",
      "source_fingerprint": "757e18be4f020ba60389284e63c934b099aeb32000fca85c5fffa9199109aefa",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1069/storytimeline_501069427.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        1,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/1/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:7de8561e516ec22aae34c5d7",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "另一方面，丸善斯基正在稳健扎实地成长。\n虽然无法再度回到巅峰时期……但如今她开始\n期望能使出全力比赛，因而获得了新的力量。",
      "source_fingerprint": "15451db2b461509f1a8b5fcc5151294874a7d3628ed38117ccad698bf63664b2",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1069/storytimeline_501069427.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        2,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/2/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:5faaa8359e753ceb75d4f4ab",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "两人约好一战的日本杯即将到来，\n樱花千代王希望能在\n日本杯之前再多挑战一场GⅠ竞赛。",
      "source_fingerprint": "e9b6c9aeb1e478c366751b856f0dce8e303f10b6f341f52b1254a9bdc247cfc9",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1069/storytimeline_501069427.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        3,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/3/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f2465f925c28895ff7ecdc60",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "于是决定下一个目标是“天皇赏（秋）”。\n除此之外，樱花千代王又说……\n自己没问题，希望能先将自己目前的状况保密。",
      "source_fingerprint": "799ef9d90e9df0ee76ec77be2f3c73c98190934280dbb489ea11104ea188bb9f",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
